Simulated Flutter widget runner evidence for backlog item 5.

No physical battery service log was captured in this run. The visual proof
uses a Flutter widget harness that instantiates BatteryService with monitoring
disabled, simulates an 8% battery reading, and verifies the critical snackbar,
LogService entry, and one-shot autostop callback path.

Primary command evidence is captured in ../commands.log:
- RED: flutter test --no-pub test/services/battery_service_test.dart test/services/camera_service_failure_test.dart
- GREEN: flutter test --no-pub test/services/battery_service_test.dart test/services/camera_service_failure_test.dart
- ANALYZE: flutter analyze --no-pub
- VISUAL: flutter test --no-pub --update-goldens logs/verification-runs/20260608-1745-critical-battery-autostop/battery_autostop_visual_test.dart
